OL,3,C'It's like a construction site':
OL,4,CHomeowners continue to fight huge
OL,5,Cwarehouses
OL,7,FITV Granada Reports' journalist
OL,8,FJennifer Buck has spoken to residents
OL,9,Fin Astley.
OL,11,FHomeowners next to a huge warehouse
OL,12,Fcomplex say it's like "living next to
OL,13,Fa construction site" as they are
OL,14,Fcontinue their campaign against the
OL,15,Fwarehoueses.
OL,17,FThe first of four buildings next to
OL,18,FHenford Estate in Tyldesley, Wigan is
OL,19,Fopen for business, but residents say
OL,20,Fthe noise from lorries, traffic, and
OL,21,Fworkers is keeping them awake at night.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
