CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786744251
OL,3,C'It's like a construction site':
OL,4,CHomeowners continue to fight huge
OL,5,Cwarehouses
OL,7,FThe 24-hour logistics company Whistl
OL,8,Fstarted operating at the site in July,
OL,9,Fbut the 60-foot tall buildings sparked
OL,10,Fcontroversy when they were built
OL,11,Ftowering over people's gardens.
OL,13,FOne resident, Pat Court said: "Some
OL,14,Fdays I just don't open the windows,
OL,15,Four bedroom window is on the side of
OL,16,Fthe house and I just don't open the
OL,17,Fblinds because all you see is the grey
OL,18,Fbuilding.
OL,20,F"Even in the back garden it's quite
OL,21,Floud.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786744251
OL,3,C'It's like a construction site':
OL,4,CHomeowners continue to fight huge
OL,5,Cwarehouses
OL,7,F"I think the building is actually
OL,8,Famplifying the sound, so I am a bit
OL,9,Fconcerned about when the other
OL,10,Fwarehouses are in operation whether
OL,11,Fthat will have an adverse effect from
OL,12,Fa noise point of view."
OL,14,FThe Astley Warehouse Action Group
OL,15,Fbrought in a noise assessor who says
OL,16,Fit is four or five times louder than
OL,17,Fthe plans expected, which is
OL,18,Fparticularly difficult in the hot
OL,19,Fweather.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
