FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786744251
OL,3,C'It's like a construction site':
OL,4,CHomeowners continue to fight huge
OL,5,Cwarehouses
OL,7,FOne resident with three children said:
OL,8,F"You've got to have the windows open
OL,9,Fit's just too hot.
OL,11,F"It's like a construction site all
OL,12,Fnight. I work in construction and the
OL,13,Fonly time the noise ever dies away is
OL,14,Fwhen they go and have a cup of tea for
OL,15,F10 minutes."
OL,17,FLast month, residents blamed
OL,18,F'atrocious' flooding, which inundated
OL,19,Fa path to a school, on work at the
OL,20,Fconstruction site.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
