PN,36905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786744251
OL,3,C'It's like a construction site':
OL,4,CHomeowners continue to fight huge
OL,5,Cwarehouses
OL,7,FWigan Council has always insisted that
OL,8,Fplanning permission was granted in
OL,9,Fline with national and local
OL,10,Flegislation.
OL,12,FJohn Peters, from Astley Action Group
OL,13,Fsaid: "We don't think they're ever
OL,14,Fgoing to come down, we don't think the
OL,15,Fheight can be reduced, but one thing
OL,16,Fwe are hopeful for is that we can
OL,17,Freduce the working hours possibly from
OL,18,Feight in the morning til five or six
OL,19,Fat night.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786744251
OL,3,C'It's like a construction site':
OL,4,CHomeowners continue to fight huge
OL,5,Cwarehouses
OL,7,F"That would be acceptable to us and
OL,8,Fwould give us some kind of quality of
OL,9,Flife back."
OL,11,FGreater Manchester mayor Bev Craig has
OL,12,Fspoken out about the giant warehouses,
OL,13,Fpromising residents to "see what we
OL,14,Fcan do" about the situation.
OL,16,FShe said: "I've not been close to this
OL,17,Fat all, but like everybody else I've
OL,18,Fseen the warehouses, so to live next
OL,19,Fdoor to those I can't imagine what
OL,20,Fit's like.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786744251
OL,3,C'It's like a construction site':
OL,4,CHomeowners continue to fight huge
OL,5,Cwarehouses
OL,7,F"Other people can't be in the same
OL,8,Fsituation in the future, and we need
OL,9,Fto look at what we can do to help you
OL,10,Fnow."
OL,12,FWhistl started operations at the
OL,13,Ffacility in July and in a statement,
OL,14,Fthey said: "We recognise these
OL,15,Fconcerns about noise, and we want to
OL,16,Fassure residents that we are taking
OL,17,Fthe feedback we have received
OL,18,Fseriously.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786744251
OL,3,C'It's like a construction site':
OL,4,CHomeowners continue to fight huge
OL,5,Cwarehouses
OL,7,F"We held discussions with our landlord
OL,8,Fbefore occupancy about noise reduction
OL,9,Fmeasures in the design, including the
OL,10,Fbund walls, acoustic fencing and
OL,11,Fadditional soft planting. We have
OL,12,Fspoken more recently with the landlord
OL,13,Fto understand what further measures
OL,14,Fcould be taken across the building,
OL,15,Fthe surrounding area and the wider
OL,16,Fbusiness park.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786744251
OL,3,C'It's like a construction site':
OL,4,CHomeowners continue to fight huge
OL,5,Cwarehouses
OL,7,F"Prior to commencement of operations
OL,8,Fon site, we installed professional
OL,9,Fnoise measurement equipment, and we
OL,10,Fhave appointed an independent acoustic
OL,11,Fconsultancy to carry out a detailed
OL,12,Fassessment of the results. We do take
OL,13,Fthis seriously and where the report
OL,14,Fidentifies further measures that will
OL,15,Fmake a difference, we will act upon
OL,16,Fthem.
OL,18,F"We committed to meet with residents
OL,19,Fagain after a month of operations at
OL,20,Four new site and we will extend that
OL,21,Fto other representatives.."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
