OL,3,C'It's like a construction site':
OL,4,CHomeowners continue to fight huge
OL,5,Cwarehouses
OL,7,FWigan Council said: "We have met with
OL,8,FWhistl and we will be working with
OL,9,Fthem and local residents to look at
OL,10,Foptions to help mitigate any ongoing
OL,11,Foperational concerns at the site."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/10
